Thank you for your feedback! We’ve addressed your questions as follows:
We added KPIs to each budget line and included a link to the Budget Sheet in the supporting links for easier access to related documents. The Proposal Costing section has been updated with more details, including:
a) Clarification on the amount of ADA returned to the treasury and the conditions for doing so;
b) A comparison of our ROM model costs with Intersect’s administration and operational expenses;
c) A new supporting document on the Workstream Promotion Plan, incorporated into the key deliverables section and listed under supporting links.
For further details on tasks and activities, refer to the Budget Sheet’s Operations and Treasury Calculations, which includes a Task Descriptions column outlining minimum expectations.
